# dc-1-pmos rolling package repository, served from the GitHub release. The
# URL ends in APKINDEX.tar.gz so apk treats it as an index-file URL and
# resolves packages to <dir>/<name>-<version>.apk (the flat release layout).
# The index is signed with dc1-apk.rsa.pub (shipped in /usr/share/apk/keys,
# linked into /etc/apk/keys at boot by dc1-link-apk-keys).
https://github.com/denysvitali/dc-1-pmos/releases/download/latest/APKINDEX.tar.gz
